{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And He said.</b> The agent speaks in the language of the one who sent him." "And the meaning of \"seeing, I have seen\" — the violence done to them in secret, which people do not see, I see it." "<b>And their cry.</b> That all hear, I have heard; and the pains that are in his heart, I have known."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:31:11.617808377Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}